// novadeck self-chaining Proton 11 ARM64 manifest.
//
// Deliberately carries NO "require_tool_appid". Valve's official Proton 11 ARM64
// declares require_tool_appid 4185400 (the Steam Linux Runtime 4.0 Arm64 container
// it must run inside), but on a non-Deckard client that dependency is never
// REGISTERED as a compat tool even when its FILES are installed — the launch then
// dies with AppError_51 ("Tool 4185400 unknown", dependent tool cmdline wrap
// failed). We sidestep that platform-gated require_tool wiring entirely: our
// commandline points at novadeck-chain, which hand-invokes the SLR 4.0 Arm64
// container itself and then Proton inside it (the same two-stage chain, collapsed
// into one local tool). See the steam-deckard-fex-investigation memory.
"manifest"
{
	"version"     "2"
	"commandline" "/novadeck-chain %verb%"
}
